AUTHORS
=======

This file lists the authors of the VIPV data-processing and analysis code
referenced in the header of every script in this repository.


Author
------

Nathan Papillon
papillon.nathan@gmail.com

Polytech Clermont / Clermont Auvergne INP -- Physical Engineering, Energy
Research internship, April--August 2026

Instituto Dom Luiz, Faculdade de Ciencias, Universidade de Lisboa (FCUL)
Lisbon, Portugal

Sole author of the code in this repository.


Supervision
-----------

The work was carried out under the supervision of Miguel Centeno Brito
(Instituto Dom Luiz, FCUL), within the research group's ongoing work on
vehicle-integrated photovoltaics.


Use of AI assistants
--------------------

Large language models were used during development, for drafting and
refactoring code, writing docstrings and documentation, and reviewing
analysis choices. The models used were:

    Claude Sonnet 4.6   (Anthropic)
    Claude Sonnet 5     (Anthropic)
    Claude Opus 5       (Anthropic)
    GPT-5.6             (OpenAI)

All code was read, executed and validated by the author, who is
responsible for its correctness and for the results it produces. No output
was incorporated without review.


