--------

If you use this code or build on it, please cite the internship report:

    Papillon, N. (2026). Urban shading and the solar potential of
    vehicle-integrated photovoltaics: on-board irradiance measurements in
    Lisbon. Engineering internship report,
    Polytech Clermont / Clermont Auvergne INP, carried out at Instituto
    Dom Luiz, Faculdade de Ciencias, Universidade de Lisboa.
